      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Here, the clinical and imaging features of idiopathic fibrosing pancreatitis are described, including a description of the evolution of MRI features in a patient treated successfully with biliary stenting alone. Thus, not all masses of the pancreatic head in the paediatric population need to be managed surgically."},
